  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rsoning i Rwanda genom Norwegian Church Aid</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconciliation through Norwegian Church Aid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A three year reconciliation programme implemented by Norwegian Church Aid in Musanze and Kayonza Districts. The programme brings together released prisoners, their families and genocide survivors in community programmes based on common interest. The target groups are approximately 660 families and 240 young people.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett tre&#xe5;rigt f&#xf6;rsoningsprogram som implementeras av Norwegian Church Aid i Musanze och Kayonza distrikten. Programmet sammanf&#xf6;r frigivna f&#xe5;ngar, deras familjer och &#xf6;verlevare fr&#xe5;n folkmordet i program p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;. M&#xe5;lgrupperna &#xe4;r ca 660 familjer och 240 ungdomar.</narrative>
  </description>
